========================================================================
  The ML speed source is a NET LIABILITY. 'hold_last' achieves 58.5% median blackout drift against the model's 62.5%. Make 'hold_last' the production default until the model can beat it.

  The EKF is told to expect sigma_v = 0.2 m/s. The model's actual RMSE during
  blackouts is 5.70 m/s - it is 28x more wrong than the filter
  assumes. A filter that trusts a bad source follows it off the road; this is the
  mechanism behind fused being worse than naive.

